# Ignore-file for acceptance/Dockerfile. BuildKit resolves a
# <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore and it takes precedence over any root
# .dockerignore, so the acceptance Docker config stays self-contained here.
#
# NOTE: patterns are relative to the BUILD CONTEXT ROOT (the repo root, because
# the Dockerfile COPYs client/, server/, package.json, …), NOT to acceptance/.
#
# The image runs `npm ci` itself, so never ship host artifacts — especially
# native modules built for macOS.
**/node_modules
client/tmp
**/.vscode-test
**/out
*.vsix
.git
.gemstone
gemstone

# Acceptance-test outputs + caches (regenerated / re-fetched inside the container)
acceptance/.features-gen
acceptance/cucumber-report
acceptance/test-results
acceptance/playwright-report
acceptance/.download-cache
acceptance/manual/dist
acceptance/manual/.astro

# Scratch handoff plan — never enters an image
NEXT.md

# Local test-stone connection details — a darwin path, useless in the container
client/.env.test
client/.env.test.local

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
.idea
